<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended higher in active trading Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 44.95 to 6703.55. For the week, the Dow gained a record 311.86 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.99 to 402.64. For the week, the index rose a record 13.17 points.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.20.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1499 to 924.</p>
<p>Volume was 468,159,230 compared with 502,813,220 on Thursday. Weekly volume totalled 2,391,579,230 shares.</p>
